{
  "name": "dsh-whale-widget",
  "version": "0.4.2-fork.1",
  "description": "DSH Web 界面右下角的 DeepSeek 余额小鲸鱼挂件:余额/今日已用/峰谷定价、自定义泡泡点击序列(文本/余额/今日/峰谷/图片/随机语句与并列加权选择)、逐行样式与字体、悬浮快捷编辑、音效与每轮消耗、自定义角色/动图/音效、吸附与翻转自定义。本 fork 基于上游 0.4.2,新增「今日请求数 / 今日 token 用量」泡泡模块(宿主读 $DSH_HOME/sessions 聚合全部工作区,占位符 {reqs}/{tokens}/{tokens_billed}/{tokens_in}/{tokens_out}/{tokens_cache}/{tokens_raw}/{cache_hit})。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "balance",
    "widget"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.png",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "icon.png",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "README.md",
    "FORK-NOTES.md",
    "PROVENANCE.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/run-all.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/change-ouyang/dsh-whale-widget.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/change-ouyang/dsh-whale-widget/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/change-ouyang/dsh-whale-widget#readme",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
